cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the trained models, please cite the associated publication."
type: software
title: "5' and 3' UTR translational regulatory features: ML pipeline and trained models"
abstract: >
  Machine learning pipeline for discovering translation regulatory features
  and cross-UTR interactions from TIF-seq2 transcript isoform data, developed
  for the manuscript "Discovery of Translation Regulatory Features and
  Cross-UTR Interactions through Precise Mapping of mRNA Ends and Machine
  Learning."
